ongest specifications, materials, overclocking range.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>11/09/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of e-zone Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"Printed magazine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/201911282056559020023.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardware Cooking\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Some Raw Power !\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>01/29/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarecooking.fr/test-asus-rog-strix-rtx-3090-o24g-gaming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/201911271728514030383.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Overclocking.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      This Asus RTX 3090 Strix OC is a beast ! It is for sure the best available on the market [...] and Asus perfectly designed this card to be silent with excellent VRM. It will please the niche enthusiasts audience as well as overclockers who dream of breaking records.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>10/23/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://overclocking.com/test-asus-rtx-3090-strix-oc/amp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202107291849158520933.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Best getest\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Computer! Totaal\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Best getest</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Both the construction and the finish are top notch as per usual.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>02/02/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of Best getest\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://computertotaal.nl/artikelen/pc/nvidia-geforce-rtx-3080-en-rtx-3090-eindelijk-gamen-in-4k/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001092249208200773.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techtesters.eu\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Thick looks, complete feature set, top cooling performance, and room within the bios limits to enjoy overclocking if you want to go crazy.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>12/03/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techtesters.eu/asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-3090-oc-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001102312300380999.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Top Pick\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Top Pick</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Hot daumn! Somehow ASUS perpetually manages to bring a bit extra to the table with their flagship products. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>10/09/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of Top Pick\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/articles-pages/asus-geforce-rtx-3090-strix-oc-review,1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1302/202109231550367240088.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"8.0 Pokde Rating\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pokde\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>8.0 Pokde Rating</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      NVIDIA’s BFGPU may be difficult to get in the current situation which sees shortages for pretty much every silicon product, but availability should still be better than the GeForce RTX 3080. The value proposition of the GeForce RTX 3090 is definitely nowhere near as good as its slightly smaller brethren, but if you want the best of the best, this is it. And the ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 3090 OC Edition might just be the best of the best of the best… Or is it? Well, that’s what we are here to find out.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>MALAYSIA</span> <span>04/16/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of 8.0 Pokde Rating\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pokde.net/review/asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-3090-oc-edition-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1302/202009250039173470973.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Pokdeward Bronze\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pokde\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Pokdeward Bronze</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      We finally got our hands on the most affordable GeForce RTX 3090 in Malaysia, the ASUS TUF Gaming GeForce RTX 3090. The card here is not overclocked, so it will be running reference clocks. But ASUS did slap on a sweet 2.7-slot, triple fan cooler onto a custom PCB designed by ASUS, so while the clocks are NVIDIA reference, nothing else on this card is. Let’s check it out.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>MALAYSIA</span> <span>11/16/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3090-O24G-GAMING Media review Award of Pokdeward Bronze\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pokde.net/review/asus-tuf-gaming-geforce-rtx-3090-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__rewardMoreButton__NCAU7\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Giải thưởng\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper__-NXix\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewTitle__0lBVH\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 class=\"pageVideo vnRogFont ProductAwardVideo__vnRogFontSize__n4Ouu\">Video review</h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(13)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContentScroll__+rpKV\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContainer__SWxvv\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Video review from HDTanel\nRating 9,5/10\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/DEelqhCKa70/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">Video review from HDTanel\nRating 9,5/10</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionV